      "featured": false,
      "name": "Tempad 3.0.0",
      "version_number": "3.0.0",
      "changelog": "1.21 Release\nAll new blocks and items:\n\n- Card Wallet (Item that holds location cards)\n- Time Steel\n- Knowledge Projector (In Game Guide)\n- Chronon Generator (New energy generating item)\n- Chronon Cell (New energy storage item)\n- Timedoor Projector (New early game teleporter block/item)\n- Timedoor Marker (New early game location marking block)\n- Location Broadcaster (Allows other players to teleport to you)\n- Chronon Battery (Bigger chronon cell)\n- Chronometer (Better chronon generator)\n- Time Twister (New device for travelling back to previous locations)\n- Workstation (New Block for block form of Tempad)\n- Metronome (Block form of Chronometer)\n- Screening Device (Advanced form of Location Broadcaster)\n\nCheck out this video by SirColor to learn more about the new blocks and items!\n\nIn addition, there is now mod compat for:\n1. Cadmus\n    - Allows you to disable timedoor summoning on claimed land\n3. Argonauts\n    - Allows you to filter guildmates and party members specifically to teleport to your Chronomarks or to you via filtering on the Screening Device\n5. Jade\n    - All blocks have relevant information, and Timedoors now show where they're headed and the name of the location\n7. Dark Mode Everywhere\n    - Screens aren't dimmed\n8. FTB Teams\n    - Similar to Argonauts, you can filter teammates to teleport to you via the Screening Device or to your Chronomarks\n9. Curios\n    - Several items have dedicated slots you can put them in, and they will render on the player",
